<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures untraded on uncertainty.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures untraded on uncertainty.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney wheat futures  were tradeless on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Grains traders said uncertainty over the future direction of international wheat prices and the impact on local markets was sidelining activity.</p>
<p>Local markets found little direction from a mixed close overnight in CBOT trading.</p>
